## Immutable Security Constraints
- tenant_id isolation is MANDATORY on every database query.
- Raw SQL is FORBIDDEN. Use SQLAlchemy ORM exclusively.
- MD5 and SHA-1 are FORBIDDEN. Use bcrypt for passwords, AES-256-GCM for encryption.
- Floating-point arithmetic is FORBIDDEN for monetary values.
- eval(), exec(), os.system(), and subprocess.run() are FORBIDDEN.

